description=Enables VN VoLTE & VoWiFi on all Qualcomm Pixels before Pixel 6 (Pixel 1..5a 5G) across Stock ROMs and Custom ROMs (LineageOS, crDroid, PixelOS, Android 10-16). Supports userdebug cmd phone cc, ICCID XML cache, dynamic ImsService detection, and Google-signed ROW MBN overlay.
